		{"id":"59eab6beb88c870a","type":"group","x":1800,"y":1740,"width":1374,"height":495,"label":"Itsuka Modeling"},
		{"id":"54547cda43dcbc71","type":"group","x":-60,"y":360,"width":811,"height":684,"label":"Control Panel Rig"},
		{"id":"0ad89a23fdf76c24","type":"group","x":-980,"y":1740,"width":747,"height":627,"label":"spaceship interior model"},
		{"id":"a63c6c878b8a2b38","type":"group","x":-60,"y":-320,"width":760,"height":599,"label":"Spaceship Rig"},
		{"id":"ec932a431cfcedb1","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260213025355.png","x":2144,"y":590,"width":314,"height":247},
		{
			"id":"eecd5069a316e7c7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Control panel rig complete:\n- Joystick controls\n- Center button controls\n- World control for entire model",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-40,
			"y":389,
			"width":360,
			"height":260
		},
		{
			"id":"0b5e086e848bbe74",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### 1.2.0\n- **Finger weight issue fixed (added weights to new oriented finger joints)** *(new)*\n- **Teeth and tongue skin bound to jaw (opens/closes with mouth)** *(new)*\n\n## Current Limitations\n- Twist joints: Coming in next update\n- Eyelid/eyebrow deformation: Minor issues—fixing next update\n- Geo selection attribute: Not working properly—fixing next update\n- Pants/jacket gap: Shows when bending forward more than 70°—fixing next update\n- Teeth and tongue: No controllers yet—coming later\n\n## Upcoming Features\n- Twist joints\n- Teeth and tongue controllers\n- Eyelid/eyebrow deformation fixes\n- Geo selection fix\n- Pants/jacket gap fix\n- **Thumb curl separation from all curl** *(new)*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":780,
			"y":520,
			"width":600,
			"height":320
		},
		{"id":"285f528321d3323d","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260213030006.png","x":-31,"y":692,"width":350,"height":310},
		{
			"id":"9423d6ed4318b390",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"there are 3 custom attibutes in the bigger controllers speed - how fast the meteorite travels along its local Z axis (where the arrow is pointing) rotation - seed that determines the tumble direction (change value to get a different spin axis) rotationSpeed - how fast the meteorite spins on that axis these will help you to animate the astroids quickly",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-980,
			"y":-300,
			"width":400,
			"height":300
		},
		{"id":"f62230c787cd9a96","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/meteoriteRig.gif","x":-980,"y":48,"width":400,"height":312},
		{"id":"0f0ce1059a967230","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260306014244.png","x":-540,"y":20,"width":300,"height":340},
		{"id":"1957768907f749c4","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260306014227.png","x":-540,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":285},
		{
			"id":"f80694118eef9f10",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"expression control for effortless animation",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-580,
			"y":440,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"9e5bf780c0aca451","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260213024015.png","x":2144,"y":158,"width":314,"height":411},
		{"id":"a670d82f18d360aa","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/controlPanelRig.gif","x":359,"y":712,"width":372,"height":290},
		{"id":"b88eda59ebbaa848","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260213025941.png","x":380,"y":389,"width":351,"height":265},
		{
			"id":"486416db9f7642db",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### 1.0.0\n**Current Limitations**\n\nTwist joints: Arms and legs lack natural twisting behavior—coming in next update\nNeck gap: Back of neck shows gap at extreme rotations (modeling issue, animation-safe)\nFinger curl: Currently has minor issues—fixing next update\n\n**Visibility Controls**\nTop-level vis control toggles:\n\n**Fly controls**\nSecondary COG ctrl\n\n**Flight Controls**\nFly ctrl: Simplifies rotation and manipulation during zero-gravity/flying sequences\n**Foot Roll System**\nFoot roll attribute: Single-slider control for ball/toe/heel rotations\nFoot roll clamp: Sets threshold for when ball roll engages\n**Space Switching**\nAvailable on:\n\nIK feet\nHead\nPOV controls\n\n**Hand Controls**\nFinger curl attributes:\n\nIndividual finger curls\nMaster \"all fingers\" curl",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":780,
			"y":-231,
			"width":600,
			"height":347
		},
		{"id":"77c7135d049e8e53","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260213023624.png","x":1418,"y":585,"width":297,"height":341},
		{
			"id":"3c143737f2a06d75",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Updated to the most current spaceship model",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-40,
			"y":0,
			"width":260,
			"height":88
		},
		{
			"id":"f4dd4dfb3d90af5e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"### 1.1.0\n\n## Current Limitations\n- Twist joints: Coming in next update\n- **Eyelid/eyebrow deformation: Minor issues—fixing next update** *(new)*\n- **Geo selection attribute: Not working properly—fixing next update** *(new)*\n- **Pants/jacket gap: Shows when bending forward more than 70°—fixing next update** *(new)*\n- **Teeth and tongue: Not rigged yet** *(new)*\n\n## Visibility Controls\n- Top-level vis control toggles: Fly controls, Secondary COG ctrl\n- **Locked attributes on all setting controls (IK/FK switches, vis switches)** *(new)*\n\n## Flight Controls\n- Fly ctrl: Simplifies rotation and manipulation during zero-gravity/flying sequences\n\n## Foot Roll System\n- Foot roll attribute: Single-slider control for ball/toe/heel rotations\n- Foot roll clamp: Sets threshold for when ball roll engages\n\n## Space Switching\n- Available on: IK feet, Head, POV controls\n\n## Hand Controls\n- Finger curl attributes: Individual + master \"all fingers\" curl\n\n## Face Rig *(new)*\n- **Eyebrow, eyelid, and lip controls**\n- **Multiplier attributes for eyebrow and eyelid (controls joint influence)**\n\n## Fixed This Update\n- **Finger controls** *(new)*\n- **Neck gap issue** *(new)*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":780,
			"y":154,
			"width":600,
			"height":326
		},
		{"id":"a32665901a453e83","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260306015245.png","x":1418,"y":149,"width":297,"height":400},
		{"id":"43f78788ff719a86","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260306015444.png","x":1418,"y":-235,"width":297,"height":351},
		{"id":"ca086e39df3825a0","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260306014812.png","x":280,"y":0,"width":400,"height":267},
		{
			"id":"b1614fae395c8b74",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"A very basic spaceship rig with triple fly controls and special control visibility settings and geo selectablility switch.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-40,
			"y":-292,
			"width":260,
			"height":212
		},
		{"id":"f108e5d45307fd99","type":"file","file":"z Hidden/z hidden images/Pasted image 20260213025549.png","x":1418,"y":945,"width":297,"height":245},
